# SysWizard — Environment Variables

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Database (Prisma / SQLite)
# Used only by the optional Prisma client. The core app uses localStorage for auth/progress.
# For Vercel: set this to a writable path, or switch to a real DB (Postgres/PlanetScale).
# Local dev: file:./db/custom.db
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI Tutor (Rishi — powered by z-ai-web-dev-sdk → GLM-4-Plus)
# The SDK looks for a .z-ai-config file OR you can set these env vars:
# ZAI_BASE_URL="https://your-api-endpoint/v1"
# ZAI_API_KEY="your-api-key"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Next.js
NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1
